swered something you didn't ask. In answer to your actual question, OOC that is something everyone expects to happen, more or less. We will see if it actually does. Wolfram being German (as in a German German) is a minus for him in Lizette's eyes (she does not like the idea of being &quot;conquered&quot; by a German even if, in her rational mind, she thinks that is bullshit), and there is the question of heirs to consider, with no birth control as yet. Lizette is less fertile than a normal woman, but not infertile.<br /> <br /> Keeping old answer for posterity.<br /> <br /> Not impossible. However, Christina and Marlene are not attracted to each other. It would be a lie to say Lizette pings male for them (she is curvy and feminine, smells feminine and does not deny that part of herself) but she is a brave, cunning, and resourceful adventuress. Christina is only attracted to women under specific circumstances, and Lizette has shown off being a badass and pursued her. Marlene is more broadly bi but they two grew up together, and Christina is like a sister. So unlikely, and if it happened they would not be, uh, interacting with each other (even accidentally is unlikely given Lizette is a meter high and green.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/va